Measurement and metrology sources — books, guides, and research (@met-sources: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @metrology) { r_6H584EJ2Z9D11PG89Y21Y8T1A3
These are particular books, technical guides, reports, and reference documents to read. Every source Record states the assigned scope, edition, authorized access, and known publication terms. English and Portuguese SI/VIM references are reused from the shared quantitative sources.

